      "japanese": "{買|か}い{物|もの}のあとで{友|とも}だちとお{茶|ちゃ}した。",
      "english": "After shopping I had tea with a friend.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "30177_ochasuru_ex3",
      "japanese": "{時間|じかん}があるなら、{駅前|えきまえ}のカフェでお{茶|ちゃ}しながら{話|はな}しませんか。",
      "english": "If you have time, shall we talk over tea at the café in front of the station?",
